{"arxiv_id": "1905.12131v2", "title": "Adaptive Deep Kernel Learning", "normalized_lane": "metalearning_fewshot", "verdict": "ADAPT", "doctrine_tag": "PROPRIETARY_EDGE", "improvement": "Add an ADKL meta-learner over team-season tasks: DeepSets task encoder psi_eta into a regime embedding z^t (InfoNCE-regularized), conditional embedding phi_theta, ADKL-KRR head for margin and ADKL-GP head for win probability, with closed-form per-team kernel adaptation on <=4 support games at inference; monitor z^t drift as an automatic regime-shift detector.", "gate": "ADOPT iff ADKL-KRR/GP beats the league-average prior by >=0.01 Brier on new-regime first-4-game predictions (2023-2025 LOSO) AND beats fixed-kernel DKL by >=0.005 Brier (proves the task-conditioning, not just the deep kernel, transfers).", "owner": "Hermes", "bucket": "MODEL", "effort": "large", "depends_on": []}
